  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems. The digest job and notification service tests pass, and type-checking shows no errors in the changed files.\n\n1. **Who gets a digest:** the recipient list in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now only includes people who chose digest delivery for at least one kind of notification. Before, anyone who had changed any notification setting in the workspace was included.\n2. **Which updates are kept:** in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts`, updates are now sorted newest first before the cap is applied. The digest keeps the most recent updates, and the headline is the newest one.\n3. **Deleted (archived) workspaces:** these no longer send digests. The job's hourly check in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` now skips archived workspaces, and the digest builder also returns nothing for them as a second safeguard. Live workspaces work as before.",
